<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, You also are judging us today.</l><l>As Your church, Lord, take us all the way.</l><l>As You judge by cutting, snuffing, trimming</l><l>Out the negatives we now MUST PRAY.</l><l>Lord, we all want to let You LOOK AT US.</l><l>Lord, expose the degradation thus,</l><l>Judge our living, working;</l><l>Let us also hear Your voice,</l><l>Your work in us be done.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
